<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Hardened Web Server - {{ ansible_facts['hostname'] }}</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0f172a;
            --card-bg: #1e293b;
            --card-border: #334155;
            --text-main: #f8fafc;
            --text-muted: #94a3b8;
            --accent-green: #10b981;
            --accent-blue: #38bdf8;
            --accent-purple: #818cf8;
            --tag-bg: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);
            --tag-border: #059669;
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            line-height: 1.6;
            padding: 2.5rem 1rem;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 960px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .header-card {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e293b 0%, #0f172a 100%);
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .header-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 6px;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--accent-green) 0%, var(--accent-blue) 100%);
        }
        .badges-container {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        .badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
            border-radius: 9999px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        }
        .badge-secure {
            background-color: var(--tag-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--tag-border);
            color: #34d399;
        }
        .badge-info {
            background-color: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15);
            border: 1px solid #0284c7;
            color: #38bdf8;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        }
        .subtitle {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            max-width: 700px;
        }
        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-top: 1.75rem;
        }
        .stat-card {
            background-color: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.7);
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 1.25rem;
        }
        .stat-label {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        }
        .stat-value {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin-top: 0.35rem;
            word-break: break-all;
        }
        .content-card {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        h2 {
            font-size: 1.35rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }
        .security-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 0.92rem;
        }
        .security-table th, .security-table td {
            text-align: left;
            padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--card-border);
        }
        .security-table th {
            background-color: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        }
        .status-pill {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.35rem;
            color: #34d399;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .code-box {
            background-color: #0b1120;
            border: 1px solid #1e293b;
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 1rem;
            font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #38bdf8;
            overflow-x: auto;
            margin-top: 0.75rem;
        }
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            padding-top: 1rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header-card">
            <div class="badges-container">
                <span class="badge badge-secure">&#10004; CIS Benchmark Hardened</span>
                <span class="badge badge-info">TLS 1.3 / 1.2 Enforced</span>
                <span class="badge badge-info">Nftables Protected</span>
            </div>
            <h1>Hardened Enterprise Web Server</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">Sistem web server terverifikasi dengan konfigurasi hardening komprehensif mengikuti standar Center for Internet Security (CIS) Level 2 Server Benchmark.</p>

            <div class="grid">
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <div class="stat-label">Hostname Node</div>
                    <div class="stat-value">{{ ansible_facts['hostname'] }}</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <div class="stat-label">IP Address</div>
                    <div class="stat-value">{{ ansible_facts.get('default_ipv4', {}).get('address', ansible_host) }}</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <div class="stat-label">Operating System</div>
                    <div class="stat-value">{{ ansible_facts['distribution'] }} {{ ansible_facts['distribution_version'] }}</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <div class="stat-label">Kernel Release</div>
                    <div class="stat-value">{{ ansible_facts['kernel'] }}</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="content-card">
            <h2>Parameter Keamanan Web Server Aktif</h2>
            <table class="security-table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Fitur Keamanan</th>
                        <th>Status Penerapan</th>
                        <th>Detail Konfigurasi</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Server Tokens & Banners</strong></td>
                        <td><span class="status-pill">&#10004; Dihilangkan</span></td>
                        <td><code>server_tokens off</code> (Versi Nginx dan OS disembunyikan dari header)</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Enkripsi Transport Layer</strong></td>
                        <td><span class="status-pill">&#10004; Terproteksi</span></td>
                        <td>Hanya TLSv1.2 & TLSv1.3 dengan cipher suite AEAD modern & DHParam 2048-bit</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Strict-Transport-Security (HSTS)</strong></td>
                        <td><span class="status-pill">&#10004; Aktif</span></td>
                        <td><code>max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload</code></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Anti-Clickjacking Protection</strong></td>
                        <td><span class="status-pill">&#10004; Terproteksi</span></td>
                        <td><code>X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN</code></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Anti-MIME Sniffing</strong></td>
                        <td><span class="status-pill">&#10004; Terproteksi</span></td>
                        <td><code>X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff</code></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Content Security Policy (CSP)</strong></td>
                        <td><span class="status-pill">&#10004; Dibatasi</span></td>
                        <td>Restriksi ketat sumber script, frame, dan koneksi eksternal</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>HTTP Methods Restriction</strong></td>
                        <td><span class="status-pill">&#10004; Dibatasi</span></td>
                        <td>Hanya mengizinkan metode GET, HEAD, dan POST (menolak PUT, DELETE, TRACE)</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Dotfiles & Hidden File Protection</strong></td>
                        <td><span class="status-pill">&#10004; Diblokir</span></td>
                        <td>Akses ke <code>/.git</code>, <code>/.env</code>, dsb ditolak dengan status 403 Forbidden</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Firewall Ingress Filtering</strong></td>
                        <td><span class="status-pill">&#10004; Nftables State</span></td>
                        <td>Default-deny; hanya port 22 (SSH), 80 (HTTP), dan 443 (HTTPS) yang diizinkan</td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>

        <div class="content-card">
            <h2>Pengujian & Verifikasi Header Keamanan</h2>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.95rem;">Lakukan verifikasi integritas respon header web server dari Ansible controller atau terminal lokal:</p>
            <div class="code-box">
curl -I -k https://{{ ansible_facts.get('default_ipv4', {}).get('address', ansible_host) }}
            </div>
        </div>

        <footer>
            Ansible Security Hardening Framework &bull; Managed Host: {{ inventory_hostname }}
        </footer>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
